# Jolli Claude Code plugin marketplace
#
# Policy: only the plugin-distribution files belong on the remote.
# This is an allowlist — ignore everything at the repo root by default,
# then re-include the handful of files/dirs the marketplace actually ships.
#
# Anything not re-included below is local/dev-only and stays out of git:
#   .claude/   local settings + locally-installed skill copies
#   .agents/   installed skill copies for other agent runtimes
#   .gemini/   Gemini config
#   .jolli/    jolli runtime state (debug.log, sessions.json)
#   /.mcp.json dev MCP config with a machine-specific absolute path

# 1. Ignore every top-level entry.
/*

# 2. Re-include the marketplace essentials.
#    The `/**` forms re-include nested files too, so a machine-global
#    pattern (e.g. a bare `SKILL.md`) can't silently drop new plugin files.
!/.gitignore
!/.claude-plugin/
!/.claude-plugin/**
!/plugins/
!/plugins/**
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
